#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:1
#: 7b3a97ec6daa4ab1a17d3624ae82488c
msgid "Install Environment"
msgstr "环境安装"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:3
#: 2944cb63af654428976134d5637502a5
msgid ""
"This page covers installing the base development environment for FiveAges "
"Sim workspaces."
msgstr "本页介绍如何安装 FiveAges Sim 工作空间所需的基础开发环境。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:5
#: 00aa0c2191054eb3aeb20ae867db8fd7
msgid "Operating System"
msgstr "操作系统"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:7
#: e5e1946f29c14ba0958c121a3abc0adc
msgid "**Supported host:** Ubuntu 24.04 LTS (Noble Numbat) + **ROS 2 Jazzy**."
msgstr "**支持的主机：** Ubuntu 24.04 LTS（Noble Numbat）+ **ROS 2 Jazzy**。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:9
#: fe236fb0dfcf422886eab00860635c99
msgid ""
"**Python:** **3.12** only (ROS 2 Jazzy on Ubuntu 24.04). Do not use "
"3.10/3.11 venvs for this stack."
msgstr ""
"**Python：** 仅 **3.12**（Ubuntu 24.04 上的 ROS 2 Jazzy）。本技术栈不要使用 3.10/3.11 虚拟环境。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:11
#: b01ec0089bff47e7909965c8354313f8
msgid ""
"Other Linux distros (for example Debian 13) are **not** supported natively. "
"An `ubuntu:24.04` container on that host is a workable approach for the same"
" apt steps below. `open-deploy-ws` does not publish an official Docker image"
" or extra container flags; use a stock Ubuntu 24.04 userspace and the "
"official ROS 2 Jazzy Ubuntu install."
msgstr ""
"其他 Linux 发行版（例如 Debian 13）**没有**原生支持。在该主机上用 `ubuntu:24.04` 容器跑下面同一套 apt "
"步骤是可行做法。`open-deploy-ws` 没有发布官方 Docker 镜像，也没有额外容器参数；使用原版 Ubuntu 24.04 "
"用户空间和官方 ROS 2 Jazzy Ubuntu 安装即可。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:13
#: f1d23d0f4c8b492baccbc9d80c80a2d2
msgid ""
"Follow the [open-deploy-ws README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-"
"deploy-ws/blob/main/README.EN.md) after ROS 2 + rosdep are in place. The "
"workspace entry is **`./init_repo.sh`**; after `colcon build`, `source "
"install/setup.bash` in the launch terminal."
msgstr ""
"ROS 2 + rosdep 就绪后，按 [open-deploy-ws README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/main/README.EN.md)。工作区入口是 "
"**`./init_repo.sh`**；`colcon build` 之后，在启动终端 `source install/setup.bash`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:15
#: 1e8a20ce38bc4d97be082627c5f27e7b
msgid "ROS 2 Jazzy on a bare host or container"
msgstr "在裸机或容器上安装 ROS 2 Jazzy"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:17
#: 88fad23bd7cc4636a8f78520eb4ea40f
msgid ""
"On a **bare** Ubuntu 24.04 machine or container, `python3-colcon-common-"
"extensions`, `python3-rosdep`, and `python3-vcstool` are **not** in the "
"default Ubuntu index. `apt install` of those packages fails with “Unable to "
"locate package” until the ROS 2 apt source is added and `apt update` has "
"run."
msgstr ""
"在**裸** Ubuntu 24.04 机器或容器上，`python3-colcon-common-"
"extensions`、`python3-rosdep` 和 `python3-vcstool` **不在**默认 Ubuntu 索引里。在加入 ROS"
" 2 apt 源并执行 `apt update` 之前，`apt install` 这些包会报 “Unable to locate package”。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:19
#: 82ea4669acbd4779a41ad8c2d6535f89
msgid ""
"Source of truth: [Ubuntu (deb packages) — ROS 2 "
"Jazzy](https://docs.ros.org/en/jazzy/Installation/Ubuntu-Install-Debs.html)."
" Order:"
msgstr ""
"依据：[Ubuntu（deb 包）— ROS 2 "
"Jazzy](https://docs.ros.org/en/jazzy/Installation/Ubuntu-Install-"
"Debs.html)。顺序："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:21
#: cbe42a4c1b224963b03e59e0e45f1f75
msgid "Add the ROS key + Noble ROS 2 apt source"
msgstr "添加 ROS 密钥 + Noble 的 ROS 2 apt 源"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:22
#: 09b35901d84e4c5b8b6596255a1c5040
msgid "`apt update`"
msgstr "`apt update`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:23
#: 2e7c0531e7294b90adb0d0e565af325c
msgid ""
"Install `ros-jazzy-desktop`, `ros-dev-tools`, and the colcon / rosdep / "
"vcstool tools"
msgstr ""
"安装 `ros-jazzy-desktop`、`ros-dev-tools`，以及 colcon / rosdep / vcstool 工具"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:24
#: 26c222f42d0d42a880f1728c46d3168a
msgid "`rosdep init` / `rosdep update`"
msgstr "`rosdep init` / `rosdep update`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:26
#: 7a2ac88e0ed141309ef0152daa9b3be5
msgid "1. Enable Universe, then add the ROS 2 apt source"
msgstr "1. 启用 Universe，再添加 ROS 2 apt 源"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:28
#: 951e3ae862e1461ea6f17df52640f303
msgid ""
"Official current method — the `ros2-apt-source` package installs the signing"
" key and the Noble `packages.ros.org` source:"
msgstr "当前官方做法 — `ros2-apt-source` 包会装好签名密钥和 Noble 的 `packages.ros.org` 源："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:30
#: 59e95b10dd57427f9fbac055e509cadd
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"sudo apt update\n"
"sudo apt install software-properties-common curl -y\n"
"sudo add-apt-repository universe\n"
"\n"
"export ROS_APT_SOURCE_VERSION=$(curl -s https://api.github.com/repos/ros-infrastructure/ros-apt-source/releases/latest | grep -F \"tag_name\" | awk -F'\"' '{print $4}')\n"
"curl -L -o /tmp/ros2-apt-source.deb \"https://github.com/ros-infrastructure/ros-apt-source/releases/download/${ROS_APT_SOURCE_VERSION}/ros2-apt-source_${ROS_APT_SOURCE_VERSION}.$(. /etc/os-release && echo ${UBUNTU_CODENAME:-${VERSION_CODENAME}})_all.deb\"\n"
"sudo dpkg -i /tmp/ros2-apt-source.deb"
msgstr ""
"sudo apt update\n"
"sudo apt install software-properties-common curl -y\n"
"sudo add-apt-repository universe\n"
"\n"
"export ROS_APT_SOURCE_VERSION=$(curl -s https://api.github.com/repos/ros-infrastructure/ros-apt-source/releases/latest | grep -F \"tag_name\" | awk -F'\"' '{print $4}')\n"
"curl -L -o /tmp/ros2-apt-source.deb \"https://github.com/ros-infrastructure/ros-apt-source/releases/download/${ROS_APT_SOURCE_VERSION}/ros2-apt-source_${ROS_APT_SOURCE_VERSION}.$(. /etc/os-release && echo ${UBUNTU_CODENAME:-${VERSION_CODENAME}})_all.deb\"\n"
"sudo dpkg -i /tmp/ros2-apt-source.deb"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:40
#: c65ca538e9f14645b2e9d5a2b57f70f8
msgid ""
"Equivalent **hand-added** source (same idea: `ros.key` + Noble ROS 2 list), "
"if you are not using `ros2-apt-source`:"
msgstr ""
"等价的**手工添加**源（同一思路：`ros.key` + Noble 的 ROS 2 列表），若不用 `ros2-apt-source`："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:42
#: 818e61a1a800474c8c07e45a1d259359
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"sudo apt install curl gnupg lsb-release -y\n"
"sudo curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros/rosdistro/master/ros.key -o /usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg\n"
"echo \"deb [arch=$(dpkg --print-architecture) signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg] http://packages.ros.org/ros2/ubuntu $(. /etc/os-release && echo ${UBUNTU_CODENAME:-${VERSION_CODENAME}}) main\" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/ros2.list > /dev/null"
msgstr ""
"sudo apt install curl gnupg lsb-release -y\n"
"sudo curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros/rosdistro/master/ros.key -o /usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg\n"
"echo \"deb [arch=$(dpkg --print-architecture) signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg] http://packages.ros.org/ros2/ubuntu $(. /etc/os-release && echo ${UBUNTU_CODENAME:-${VERSION_CODENAME}}) main\" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/ros2.list > /dev/null"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:48
#: b7249ca3da63448ebdd043aa3703abf4
msgid ""
"On some Ubuntu 24.04 images, `/etc/apt/sources.list.d/ubuntu.sources` only "
"lists the base `noble` suite. Official Jazzy docs: include `noble-updates` "
"and `noble-backports` before installing `ros-dev-tools`, then `sudo apt "
"clean && sudo apt update && sudo apt full-upgrade -y`."
msgstr ""
"部分 Ubuntu 24.04 镜像里，`/etc/apt/sources.list.d/ubuntu.sources` 只列了基础 `noble` "
"套件。官方 Jazzy 文档：安装 `ros-dev-tools` 前先纳入 `noble-updates` 和 `noble-"
"backports`，然后执行 `sudo apt clean && sudo apt update && sudo apt full-upgrade "
"-y`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:50
#: eb9578ad1f8d45ad9305a7fa0beabb29
msgid ""
"In a container or CI job, `export DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive` is the "
"usual apt setting (not an `open-deploy-ws` flag)."
msgstr ""
"在容器或 CI 任务里，`export DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive` 是常见的 apt 设置（不是 `open-"
"deploy-ws` 的参数）。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:52
#: e50e2ca944984af3bb2216854c980a80
msgid "2. Update, then install desktop + dev tools"
msgstr "2. 更新，再安装桌面版 + 开发工具"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:54
#: e03647af474945c4a53f3b167268f0fb
msgid ""
"sudo apt update\n"
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-desktop ros-dev-tools\n"
"sudo apt install python3-colcon-common-extensions python3-rosdep python3-vcstool"
msgstr ""
"sudo apt update\n"
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-desktop ros-dev-tools\n"
"sudo apt install python3-colcon-common-extensions python3-rosdep python3-vcstool"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:60
#: 95e533b355ab42e0ba5958ea9726d017
msgid ""
"`ros-dev-tools` usually already pulls colcon / rosdep / vcstool. The second "
"line is harmless if they are installed, and it is the check that those names"
" resolve **after** the ROS apt source exists."
msgstr ""
"`ros-dev-tools` 通常已经带上 colcon / rosdep / vcstool。第二行在它们已安装时是无害的，用来确认这些包名在 "
"**ROS apt 源已存在之后** 能解析到。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:62
#: 1b916c6c5459451d915dea03b765a260
msgid "3. Overlay and rosdep"
msgstr "3. Overlay 与 rosdep"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:64
#: 86c20756368a4cf6a92bb58df86b5df4
msgid ""
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"sudo rosdep init   # first time on this machine; skip if already initialized\n"
"rosdep update"
msgstr ""
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"sudo rosdep init   # first time on this machine; skip if already initialized\n"
"rosdep update"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:70
#: b3048b12760a43bda8a6f72373c839b9
msgid ""
"After this, clone a deploy workspace and run **`./init_repo.sh`**. CI / no "
"TTY (after [open-deploy-ws#8](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/pull/8), or once you pull that script): `./init_repo.sh --public "
"--ocs2=deb --arms=source --common=source`. Details: [open-deploy-ws "
"Setup](3-open_deploy_ws.md). Then `source install/setup.bash` after `colcon "
"build`."
msgstr ""
"完成后，克隆部署工作区并运行 **`./init_repo.sh`**。CI / 无 TTY（[open-deploy-"
"ws#8](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/pull/8) "
"合入后，或已拉到带这些参数的脚本）：`./init_repo.sh --public --ocs2=deb --arms=source "
"--common=source`。细节：[open-deploy-ws 配置](3-open_deploy_ws.md)。`colcon build` "
"之后再 `source install/setup.bash`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:72
#: 3791f3cd7da2482e93021aee7475be29
msgid "Optional shortcut: fishros"
msgstr "可选捷径：fishros"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:74
#: f7b1c88b2d07471a933a8b83c7472622
msgid ""
"The [open-deploy-ws README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/main/README.EN.md) lists **fishros** first. That helper can add the "
"ROS apt source and install Jazzy for you. It is an optional shortcut, not "
"the only path, and it is a poor fit for a non-interactive container (the "
"installer is a menu)."
msgstr ""
"[open-deploy-ws README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/main/README.EN.md) 把 **fishros** 写在最前面。该助手可以帮你添加 ROS apt 源并安装 "
"Jazzy。它是可选捷径，不是唯一路径，也不适合无交互容器（安装器是菜单）。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:76
#: 4e0d6017b00b4318a0a91a1ff2e21fe9
msgid ""
"wget http://fishros.com/install -O fishros && bash fishros\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-desktop\n"
"sudo rosdep init\n"
"rosdep update"
msgstr ""
"wget http://fishros.com/install -O fishros && bash fishros\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-desktop\n"
"sudo rosdep init\n"
"rosdep update"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:84
#: 27a09197a02040559f0e6256a8639064
msgid ""
"If fishros is not available, or `apt` still cannot see `python3-colcon-"
"common-extensions` / `ros-jazzy-desktop`, use the official apt-source order "
"above."
msgstr ""
"若没有 fishros，或 `apt` 仍然看不到 `python3-colcon-common-extensions` / `ros-jazzy-"
"desktop`，用上面的官方 apt 源顺序。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:86
#: ea1c9dbe8a7d4d56a8c4083e521e1680
msgid "OCS2 Installation"
msgstr "安装 OCS2"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:88
#: 9f96e84f8a0d4627abbda8c4382e36db
msgid "OCS2 (Optimal Control for Switched Systems) is a core dependency."
msgstr "OCS2（切换系统最优控制，Optimal Control for Switched Systems）是核心依赖。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:90
#: 8ebe1d5efc444b20b68e3e432f1f3c33
msgid ""
"OCS2 is **not** published to Debian / ROS apt software sources. The `.deb` "
"package name is still `ros-jazzy-ocs2`. **Do not** treat `sudo apt install` "
"or a hand-run `dpkg -i` as the primary path."
msgstr ""
"OCS2 **没有**发布到 Debian / ROS apt 软件源。`.deb` 包名仍是 `ros-jazzy-ocs2`。**不要**把 "
"`sudo apt install` 或手跑 `dpkg -i` 当作主路径。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:92
#: 40cb7abd01f24de8a71165e00a9df723
msgid ""
"Use the deploy-workspace scripts in `open-deploy-ws` or `fa-deploy-ws`. They"
" already switch and install OCS2 (GitHub Release `.deb` or source)."
msgstr ""
"使用 `open-deploy-ws` 或 `fa-deploy-ws` 的部署工作空间脚本。它们已经负责切换并安装 OCS2（GitHub "
"Release `.deb` 或源码）。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:94
#: fa6a0eb3db664318b3485de44a587313
msgid ""
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws   # or fa-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws   # or fa-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:99
#: b8df08674bf44e95870b6f8c9cdeaf7b
msgid "What the script does (from the open-deploy-ws README):"
msgstr "脚本做什么（摘自 open-deploy-ws README）："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:94
#: 6ba360776799419fa53217f3834ba90e
msgid "Menu"
msgstr "菜单"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:94
#: 430d860841994f32ba79060f40611a8a
msgid "Role"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:94
#: db8b5c822ed2451e80dbc1c368cfdcb7
msgid "**1) 初始化工作空间**"
msgstr "**1) 初始化工作空间**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:94
#: cb49ccad30f04b9e8cf033ae7714fa16
msgid ""
"Nested visibility, then per-module `d` (GitHub Release `.deb`) or `s` "
"(source). OCS2 default is **deb**."
msgstr "先选嵌套可见性，再按模块选 `d`（GitHub Release `.deb`）或 `s`（源码）。OCS2 默认是 **deb**。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:94
#: d40440ce17e249e0b2528a58e43624d2
msgid "**2) 切换模块安装方式**"
msgstr "**2) 切换模块安装方式**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:94
#: 3d1fb8d74a47485690fad9ae0ad1d1df
msgid ""
"Switch an already-initialized module **source ↔ deb** (cleans conflicting "
"source or uninstalls the matching deb). Use this to change the OCS2 install "
"path."
msgstr "把已初始化模块在 **源码 ↔ deb** 之间切换（清理冲突源码或卸载对应 deb）。用这个改 OCS2 安装路径。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:94
#: 5fcb432cb48b481b97c4d047660d9f56
msgid "**3) 仅安装/更新核心 deb**"
msgstr "**3) 仅安装/更新核心 deb**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:94
#: 72c247214cf741fab30aba1f6441e85b
msgid "Skip Git; e.g. `./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`"
msgstr "跳过 Git；例如 `./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:94
#: a6482d60ef8943c5bdf461de1a50dd62
msgid "**4) 卸载核心 deb**"
msgstr "**4) 卸载核心 deb**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:94
#: cd1c378839144715bb2a04ea5aae19ba
msgid "e.g. `./scripts/uninstall_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`"
msgstr "例如 `./scripts/uninstall_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:94
#: 8d148b20153149e6b6d37ab5bc391a9c
msgid "**5) 仅运行 rosdep**"
msgstr "**5) 仅运行 rosdep**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:94
#: a0aebcd680684b9f93418a5550969e66
msgid "`rosdep install` on `src/` only"
msgstr "只对 `src/` 跑 `rosdep install`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:109
#: 1e0288695e684daeb830806469fb9da5
msgid ""
"Choosing `d` downloads the matching GitHub Release asset via "
"`scripts/install_core_debs.sh`. It does **not** install from "
"packages.ros.org. After init, you still `colcon build`."
msgstr ""
"选 `d` 会通过 `scripts/install_core_debs.sh` 下载匹配的 GitHub Release 资源。**不会**从 "
"packages.ros.org 安装。init 之后仍需 `colcon build`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:111
#: 022ec7f4f95d404c9251c7d570c4beee
msgid "Manual fallback"
msgstr "手动回退"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:114
#: 254acf91333a4e39a5afef9b29349f95
msgid ""
"Only if you are not using a deploy workspace. Download the matching asset "
"for your architecture and ROS distro from [ocs2_ros2 "
"Releases](https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2/releases) (filename pattern "
"`ros-jazzy-ocs2_*_<arch>.deb`), then `sudo dpkg -i ros-jazzy-ocs2_*.deb` and"
" `sudo apt-get install -f` if dpkg reports missing dependencies. For source:"
" clone branch `ros2` into `src/` — or choose `s` in `./init_repo.sh`."
msgstr ""
"仅当你没有使用部署工作空间时。从 [ocs2_ros2 "
"Releases](https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2/releases) 下载匹配架构和 ROS "
"发行版的资源（文件名形如 `ros-jazzy-ocs2_*_<arch>.deb`），然后 `sudo dpkg -i ros-jazzy-"
"ocs2_*.deb`；若 dpkg 报缺依赖再 `sudo apt-get install -f`。源码：把 `ros2` 分支克隆进 `src/` "
"— 或在 `./init_repo.sh` 里选 `s`。"

